            <h2>Your Privacy Matters</h2>
            <p>At Dynamic Decks, your privacy and personal information are important to us. We will never sell customer information to any party. All information collected by Dynamic Decks is done so to properly execute quality service to our customers.</p>

            <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
            <p>Dynamic Decks collects customer names, emails, addresses, and phone numbers as entered on the Contact Us page. This information is used solely to inquire about your project and provide you with the best possible service.</p>

            <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
            <p>Information submitted through our contact form is sent to <a href="https://formspree.io/legal/privacy-policy/" target="_blank">Formspree</a> and the management team at Dynamic Decks. Information may also be stored in Jobber to help us easily access contact details and serve your needs efficiently. Jobber's data security information is available <a href="https://www.getjobber.com/security/" target="_blank">here</a>.</p>

            <h2>Contact Us</h2>
            <p>If you have questions about our privacy policy, please call us at <a href="tel:15094643325">(509) 464-3325</a> or send us a message on our <a href="/contact">Contact page</a>.</p>
